Sugrīva praises Rāma and recounts Vālin leaping oceans catching peaks --- Dundubhi demands battle from ocean --- Ocean redirects Dundubhi to Himavat --- Himavat redirects Dundubhi to Vālin --- Dundubhi bellows at Kiṣkindhā gate --- Vālin kills Dundubhi and hurls corpse one yojana --- Mataṅga curses Vālin barring R̥śyamūka entry --- Sugrīva shows bones and sālas demanding one-arrow proof --- Rāma toe-tosses corpse ten yojanas --- Sugrīva doubts test citing shrunken dry corpse